---
// The evening of docs/produit.md, "Pour qui", told by the evening rather than by the child's faults: not knowing where to
// start, no one to help, or everyone tired; that organisation can be learned, docs/methode.md, "À retenir". An editorial
// pause on the brand's light plane: one scene, one turn, and the last words alone, under the highlighter of the top of
// the page. Nothing moves here.
---

<section class="bg-tint py-10 md:py-20 lg:py-28">
  <div class="container max-w-6xl">
    <h2 class="max-w-5xl text-2xl leading-snug text-pretty text-foreground sm:text-3xl lg:text-5xl lg:leading-tight">
      18&nbsp;h. Le cartable est ouvert, l&apos;agenda aussi, et rien n&apos;a commencé.{' '}
      <span class="text-primary">Personne pour aider ce soir, ou tout le monde est déjà fatigué.</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 lg:mt-12 lg:flex-row lg:items-baseline lg:gap-8">
      <p class="text-lg text-foreground lg:text-2xl">Souvent, ce n&apos;est pas la leçon qui bloque. C&apos;est par où commencer.</p>
      <p class="font-heading text-2xl font-extrabold text-foreground lg:text-3xl">
        <span class="highlighter">Et ça, ça s&apos;apprend.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
